验；有方案架构、技术方案编写、投标支撑、POC和交付支撑经验。\n4、客户侧方案经验：直接对接过运营商集团或省公司客户，能理解真实痛点、引导需求并输出有竞争力的解决方案。\n5、市场洞察与战略规划能力：3年以上市场洞察、行业研究、战略规划或产品规划经验，能运用BLM、五看三定、价值链等框架做结构化分析，并从零散信息中提炼战略判断。\n6、人际链接力：在运营商集团/省公司有一定真实人脉和信息渠道。","ClassificationOne":"咨询序列","ClassificationTwo":"运营商事业部","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-05T10:17:46","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"95b08277-2b83-42c1-bad3-0c76082e273b","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190876166,"PostDateInt":1793841332000,"PostDate":"2026-11-05T09:15:32","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"中级产品销售客户经理(J14861)","OrgId":700368273,"Org":"金融销售部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"30K-50K 元/月","Duty":"1. 负责华南区域重点股份制银行的大客户开拓与深度经营，完成年度销售目标；\n2. 深入分析目标银行的业务需求与数字化转型痛点，结合我司AI产品能力，设计定制化解决方案并推动落地